From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dmitry Afonchenko <undermove1@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 06:37:13 +0400
Subject: [PATCH] Meridian: Reader

The article alone in Chromium's reading view (DOM Distiller, now always
registered), from a Reader button in the site controls and "Reader" in
the command bar; again (Exit Reader) takes the page back. Only pages that
pass Chromium's readability check; others get a toast.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SwxrQ2eLfJ2bv8cCoG2va1
